      "writtenOn": "2024-01-16T22:46:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Conflate allows the buffer to be always just 1 result so the user can expect that it always has the latest scan result. The alternative would be to keep a very large buffer or allow the user to specify the buffer, which aren\u0027t necessary for DCK test cases",
      "parentUuid": "ef3e8592_ee4a7a9c",
