      "writtenOn": "2024-01-16T23:07:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Or let the user call `conflate` after `scanWithCallback` ?\n\nWhat is the issue with having a very large buffer in tests? (I think it grows automatically)",
      "parentUuid": "918993f8_51c0078b",
      "revId": "800fca855b5601bbc7ea7df89096a127db720242",
