        "id": 1869765
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-17T01:09:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027d have to specify the buffer beforehand, it doesn\u0027t grow automatically. Without any buffer (conflate will set a buffer of 1), all results are dropped in a shared flow unless collected. And I don\u0027t see a DCK test case where we have to verify all scan results to specify a buffer larger than 1.\n\nIf we see a need to specify the buffer larger than 1, we can always accept a parameter to let the user specify the buffer, but defaulting to 1 is all we need for now.",
      "parentUuid": "b10adac6_3adfbe42",
      "revId": "800fca855b5601bbc7ea7df89096a127db720242",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
