      "writtenOn": "2024-01-17T01:44:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This is a specific-purpose test utility not a production software utility. De-duplication of code is of more value than versatility.\n\nI understand that, my point is more about readability, Cold and Hot flows is a hard topic, I find code that \"hide\" which kind of flow it is behind a utility method more hard to read and like to push this information to the caller so that when you read the code it\u0027s clearer.\n\nBut at this point it\u0027s more a nitpick so you can ignore it 😊",
      "parentUuid": "6f2ebb6b_f3c4b93e",
      "revId": "800fca855b5601bbc7ea7df89096a127db720242",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
