      "message": "Would it make sense to send the complete result list in the channel here ? I don\u0027t know how much we want to test that we get specific results in one intent.\n\nThe flow of element can be easily reconstructed by the caller by using `flatMapConcat`",
      "revId": "800fca855b5601bbc7ea7df89096a127db720242",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
