      "writtenOn": "2024-01-16T22:46:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "BT toggle in my experience was taking some time and 3 secs for both turning off and back on is definitely not enough time.\n\nEven if we increase the timeout, the disable at the beginning can be skipped if BT is already disabled, so having a long timeout is unnecessary and may slow down tests.\n\nIf you\u0027re concerned about registering broadcast receiver twice for the BT state change, I am using the same flow by using a local val here so only one receiver is registered for the entire test.",
      "parentUuid": "892f04cc_156a5aa4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 281,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 281,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "800fca855b5601bbc7ea7df89096a127db720242",
