      "message": "Why does it doesn\u0027t give the same result ?\n\n```\nbluetoothStateFlow.map { it \u003d\u003d BluetoothAdapter.STATE_OFF }.first { it }\n```\n\nIs the same as\n\n```\nbluetoothStateFlow.first { it \u003d\u003d BluetoothAdapter.STATE_OFF }\n```\n\nWhich is the same as what I suggested\n\nTIL that there was a version of `first` with a predicate, thanks !",
