      "writtenOn": "2024-01-17T01:31:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`bluetoothStateFlow.map { it \u003d\u003d BluetoothAdapter.STATE_OFF }.first { it }` returns the first `true` or `false`.\n\n`bluetoothStateFlow.first { it \u003d\u003d BluetoothAdapter.STATE_OFF }` only returns the first value of `BluetoothAdapter.STATE_OFF`.\n\nIn the case of a failure (i.e. `STATE_TURNING_OFF` -\u003e `STATE_ON`), the first will return false, while the second will not return.",
